+# Plan: JSON Patch
+- New module `src/patch.ts` exporting `applyPatch`; re-exported from `src/index.ts`. No dependencies.
+- Deep-clone the document once (`structuredClone`), mutate the clone; clone `value`s taken from the patch and values copied via `copy`. Failure throws, so the caller never sees partial state.
+- Reuse `parsePointer`; helpers `getParent`, `addAt`, `removeAt`, `deepEqual`.
+- Safe own-property handling via `Object.hasOwn` / `Object.defineProperty`.
+- Tests in `test/patch.test.ts` (node:test), written first.
